1. What this package contains

The Elixir code, the component API, the LiveView hooks, the tests and the
documentation of this package are the work of DevAction.

The visual design this package reproduces, and the CSS and artwork that carry
it, derive from "LineOne - Multipurpose Admin and WebApp UI Kit based on
Tailwind CSS" by PiniaStudio, sold on ThemeForest. Those parts are NOT licensed
by this package and remain subject to the license of their author.

2. Condition of use

To use LineaUI in a project you must hold a valid license of LineOne from
ThemeForest that covers that project (per ThemeForest's terms, one license per
end product). Without it you have no right to use the parts derived from
LineOne, and therefore no right to use this package.

3. What DevAction allows

For a holder of such a license: use, copy and modify the code of this package
inside the projects the LineOne license covers. You may not redistribute or
resell this package, or a modified version of it, as a template, theme, UI kit
or component library, except as a dependency fetched from its public registry
or repository.

4. Other works

The fonts Poppins and Inter that the package ships under priv/static/fonts are
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see OFL-Poppins.txt and
OFL-Inter.txt there). Hugeicons, which the package can use through its optional
icon set, has its own license and is not part of this package.

